      },
      "raw_operands_semantics": "unconfirmed",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": 87,
          "name": "領主府衛兵",
          "text": "小姐，如果妳就這樣走了，我們都會被處罰的，請留下來吧。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": 22,
          "name": "奧帕兒",
          "text": "......。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": 87,
          "name": "領主府衛兵",
          "text": "小姐失禮了，和我們回去吧。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": 22,
          "name": "奧帕兒",
          "text": "咦？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": 6,
      "completion_flag": 0,
      "raw_operands": {
        "offset_3": 14,
        "offset_5": 111,
        "offset_7": 200,
        "offset_9": 201
      },
      "raw_operands_semantics": "unconfirmed"
    },
    {
      "type": 6,
      "completion_flag": 0,
      "raw_operands": {
        "offset_3": 14,
        "offset_5": 202,
        "offset_7": 203,
        "offset_9": 204
      },
      "raw_operands_semantics": "unconfirmed",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": 111,
          "name": "暗殺使者",
          "text": "急什麼，既然好不容易出來了，就讓我們送你回家吧！"
        },
        {
          "speaker": 87,
          "name": "領主府衛兵",
          "text": "有刺客！大家留神！"
        },
        {
          "speaker": 111,
          "name": "暗殺使者",
          "text": "那有這般容易，上！"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "completion_flag": 15,
      "trigger": {
        "kind": "turn",
        "turn": 2
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": 32,
          "name": "法爾科",
          "text": "....嘿，居然這麼多人在打架，好不熱鬧。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": 22,
          "name": "奧帕兒",
          "text": "法爾科！"
        },
        {
          "speaker": 32,
          "name": "法爾科",
          "text": "奧帕兒公主？哦....原來不是鬧著玩的。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": 22,
          "name": "奧帕兒",
          "text": "法爾科劍士，請快過來幫忙吧。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": 32,
          "name": "法爾科",
          "text": "好，我來了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
